{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#card-zh","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回退插件，在每条用户消息的操作区加入回退按钮，并通过 Host API 将选定轮次及后续模型历史以 surface replace 标记折叠。用户需连续点击两次确认；回退范围同步从界面隐藏，刷新后仍可恢复隐藏状态。插件提供轮次回退、模型历史替换、会话界面隐藏和回退状态恢复，适合需要撤回已发送提问及其后续上下文的 DSH 用户。它不删除原始日志，也不需要额外的 API key 或外部账号；安装时可用 DSH_PROFILE 选择配置档，并可用 DSH_HOME 指定 DSH 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:367-403","entry.js:474-494","src/client.js:494-624","src/client.js:294-350"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#card-en","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind adds a two-click rewind button to DSH web chats. Its Host API replaces the selected turn and later model history; the client hides those turns and restores them after reload. It helps users withdraw a prompt and its later context. Logs remain; no API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:367-403","entry.js:474-494","src/client.js:494-624","src/client.js:294-350"]}
