{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#feature-1","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 的功能「按轮次回退」：点击用户消息操作区的回退按钮并再次确认，插件通过 Host API 将该轮及后续模型可见事件替换为回退标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:494-624","entry.js:367-482"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#feature-2","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 的功能「隐藏已回退轮次」：回退后客户端按会话和轮次范围隐藏对应 transcript 节点，避免该轮及后续内容继续显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:294-326"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#feature-3","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 的功能「刷新后恢复隐藏」：客户端读取 Host 提供的会话回退状态接口，重新取得已落地的轮次范围并应用隐藏规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:336-350","entry.js:532-544"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#feature-4","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 的功能「两次点击确认」：首次点击显示确认提示，第二次点击才发送回退请求；点击其他位置可取消提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:518-553","src/client.js:612-622"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#caveat-1","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 使用 surface replace 折叠模型历史，当前代码没有撤销该替换的接口；原始日志保留，但已折叠内容无法恢复到模型上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:474-485","src/client.js:44-46"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#caveat-2","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 依赖 turnOutline 投影确定轮次边界；目标轮次起点已被 compaction 吸收时，插件会拒绝回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:161-180","entry.js:390-403"]}
{"unit_id":"LUDIWUSI12138__dsh-sqy-rewind#caveat-3","repo":"LUDIWUSI12138/dsh-sqy-rewind","commit":"b8753fc8e207f147115b63951867d88d2c58bc0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sqy-rewind 的浏览器按钮通过 DOM 注入实现，且仅对本机 loopback 请求开放回退 API；界面更新依赖消息操作区结构。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:1-18","entry.js:522-524"]}
